#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Classify a dataset {#classify-a-dataset}"
msgstr "Mengklasifikasi sebuah dataset {#classify-a-dataset}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this example, you'll use the \"Singularity Machine Learning - Classification\" function to classify a dataset consisting of two interleaving, moon-shaped half-circles. The dataset is synthetic, two-dimensional, and labeled with binary labels. It is created to be challenging for algorithms such as centroid-based clustering and linear classification.\n"
"![Moons dataset](/docs/images/guides/multiverse-computing-singularity/moon_shaped.avif)\n"
"Through this process, you'll learn how to create the classifier, fit it to the training data, use it to predict on the test data, and delete the classifier when you're finished.\n"
"Before starting, you need to install [scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/). Install it using the following command:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam contoh ini, kamu akan menggunakan fungsi \"Singularity Machine Learning - Classification\" untuk mengklasifikasi dataset yang terdiri dari dua setengah lingkaran berbentuk bulan yang saling terkait. Dataset ini bersifat sintetis, dua dimensi, dan diberi label biner. Dataset ini dirancang agar menantang bagi algoritma seperti clustering berbasis centroid dan klasifikasi linear.\n"
"![Dataset moons](/docs/images/guides/multiverse-computing-singularity/moon_shaped.avif)\n"
"Melalui proses ini, kamu akan belajar cara membuat classifier, melatihnya pada data pelatihan, menggunakannya untuk memprediksi data uji, dan menghapus classifier setelah selesai.\n"
"Sebelum mulai, kamu perlu menginstal [scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/). Instal menggunakan perintah berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Perform the following steps:\n"
msgstr "Lakukan langkah-langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1) '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create the synthetic dataset using the [`make_moons`](https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.datasets.make_moons.html) "
"function from [scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Buat dataset sintetis menggunakan fungsi [`make_moons`](https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.datasets.make_moons.html) dari "
"[scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2) '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Upload the generated synthetic dataset to the [shared data "
"directory](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-"
"serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"
msgstr ""
"Unggah dataset sintetis yang dihasilkan ke [direktori data "
"bersama](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-"
"serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3) '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create the quantum-enhanced classifier using the "
"[`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#create) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"Buat classifier yang ditingkatkan secara kuantum menggunakan aksi "
"[`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#create).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4) '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enlist your classifiers using the "
"[`list`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#list) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"Daftarkan classifier kamu menggunakan aksi "
"[`list`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#list).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5) '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Train the classifier on the train data using the "
"[`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#fit) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"Latih classifier pada data pelatihan menggunakan aksi "
"[`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#fit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6) '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the trained classifier to predict on the test data using the "
"[`predict`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#predict) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan classifier yang sudah dilatih untuk memprediksi data uji menggunakan"
" aksi [`predict`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-"
"computing-singularity#predict).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '7) '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Delete the classifier using the "
"[`delete`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#delete) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hapus classifier menggunakan aksi "
"[`delete`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#delete).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"8) Clean up after you're done.\n"
"**Step 1.** Import the necessary modules and generate the synthetic dataset, then split it into training and test datasets.\n"
msgstr ""
"8) Bersihkan setelah selesai.\n"
"**Langkah 1.** Import modul yang diperlukan dan buat dataset sintetis, lalu bagi menjadi dataset pelatihan dan uji.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Step 2.** Save the labeled training and test datasets on your local disk, "
"and then upload them to the [shared data "
"directory](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-"
"serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Langkah 2.** Simpan dataset pelatihan dan uji yang sudah diberi label ke "
"disk lokal kamu, lalu unggah ke [direktori data "
"bersama](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-"
"serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Step 3.** Create a quantum-enhanced classifier using the "
"[`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#create) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Langkah 3.** Buat classifier yang ditingkatkan secara kuantum menggunakan "
"aksi [`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-"
"computing-singularity#create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Step 4.** Train the quantum-enhanced classifier using the "
"[`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#fit) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Langkah 4.** Latih classifier yang ditingkatkan secara kuantum menggunakan"
" aksi [`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-"
"computing-singularity#fit).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Step 5.** Obtain predictions and probabilities from the quantum-enhanced "
"classifier using the "
"[`predict`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#predict) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Langkah 5.** Dapatkan prediksi dan probabilitas dari classifier yang "
"ditingkatkan secara kuantum menggunakan aksi "
"[`predict`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#predict).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Step 6.** Delete the quantum-enhanced classifier using the "
"[`delete`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#delete) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Langkah 6.** Hapus classifier yang ditingkatkan secara kuantum menggunakan"
" aksi [`delete`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-"
"computing-singularity#delete).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 7.** Clean up local and shared data directories.\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 7.** Bersihkan direktori data lokal dan bersama.\n"

